   edits limited to `origin.manifest_url` and `notes`).

**Acceptance.**
- Fixture tests for each design point (paging by `next`, `numberMatched` mismatch, duplicate id,
  WFS hits mismatch, unsortable service as partial, cap fallback, robots disallow, shuffled pages
  give identical bytes), each guard with a recorded mutation red in
