- Two branch verify dispatches over the candidates: per record level, features, bytes, checksum
  or first failing check, and equal checksums across the two runs where the layer did not change
  (`docs/program/evidence/e38/results.md`).
- `make check` green inside main's spread.

**Claim.** `src/osd/verifier/layers.py`, `src/osd/verifier/listings.py` (WFS and OGC API shapes),
`src/osd/verify.py` (`check_files` dispatch for the new formats only),
`schema/verification.schema.json` (only if a new member is needed), `tests/test_ogc_layers.py`
(new), `tests/fixtures/ogc_layers/**` (new), `records/**` (`origin.manifest_url` and `notes` of the
candidate records), `src/osd/verifier/samples.yaml` (their entries),
`docs/program/evidence/e38/**`.

